    ev('2002-03', 'SEC inquiry letter received', 'The company received an SEC inquiry letter in March 2002; the Committee notes it as one possible trigger for the capital-expenditure audit that followed.', B, 128, 'SEC inquiry letter received by the Company in March 2002', 'enforcement', '123'),
