    ev('2004-09-15', 'Superseding indictment: each filing a count', 'Ebbers was charged in a superseding indictment with conspiracy, securities fraud and seven counts of false filings with the SEC; the Second Circuit dates the nine-count indictment September 15, 2004, and the copy published by the Department of Justice (S3 02 Cr. 1144) is undated. Counts Three to Nine are the Q3 2000 10-Q, the 2000 10-K, the three 2001 10-Qs, the 2001 10-K and the Q1 2002 10-Q — all of them documents in this ledger.', 'doj-indictment-ebbers-2004', 31, 'Form 10-Q for WorldCom, Inc., \nfor the First Quarter of 2002', 'criminal', '31'),
